<title>USA: Iowa-Minn direct weekly average hog weights - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-Minn direct weekly average hog weights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iowa-Southern Minnesota direct hogs weekly average weights of barrows and gilts for the week ending November 9, 1996, according to the USDA.</p>
<p>Iowa-So Minnesota direct hogs    Receipts   Average Weight/lbs</p>
<p>week ending:  11-09-96		361,000	    254.5</p>
<p>week ending:  11-02-96		343,000	    253.7</p>
<p>year ago:     11-11-1995	    382,000	    253.6</p>
